        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Serling, Zhang Yimou\n- Roles: film director, film producer, screenwriter, television editor, writer, actor, cinematographer\n- Awards: Primetime Emmy Awards\n- Works: Jam\n\nFacts:\n- Zhang Yimou was born on 2 April 1950.\n- Zhang Yimou is a Chinese film director, producer, writer, actor, and former cinematographer.\n- Craig Serling is an American film director, film producer, screenwriter, and television editor.\n- Craig Serling received multiple Primetime Emmy nominations for Outstanding Picture Editing for Non-Fiction Programming.\n- Craig Serling made his directorial debut in 2006 with the feature film \"Jam\".",
